 DEPENDENCIES
==================================================================

* BoringSSL     (in-tree)
* lsquic        (in-tree, compiled with -DLSQUIC_WEBTRANSPORT=ON)
* libttak       (in-tree)
* SQLite3       (in-tree)
* cJSON
* uriparser
* Monocypher

